  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "## 3.1.0\n### Added\n- Required compiler-generated mappings with no reflection fallback.\n- Per-result-set ordinal mapping plans and compiled value converters.\n- Strict, Projection, and Validated mapping modes.\n- Required-property validation with MerlinRequired.\n- Recursive nested generated mappings with configurable object creation.\n- Constructor, init-only property, record, and partial access-shim support.\n- Mapping lifecycle interception through before/after auto-population hooks.\n- User Secrets, environment variable, and IConfiguration connection-string support.\n- SourceLink metadata and deterministic portable symbols.\n- MERLINSG002 compile errors for unsupported model shapes.\n\n### Changed\n- RelationalQueryEngine is now the shared provider-independent query engine.\n- Generated Create contracts remove the parameterless-constructor requirement for generated models.\n- The legacy SetDataObject(IDataReader, string) override path is obsolete.\n\n### Breaking Changes\n- Custom SetDataObject overrides should migrate to mapping lifecycle hooks or generated mapping contracts.\n- Query mapping internals and model construction behavior have changed to support source generation and Native AOT.",
